# --- Keystatic (CMS at /keystatic) ------------------------------------------
# Generated for you the first time you visit /keystatic in production and walk
# through the GitHub App setup. Copy all four into your Vercel project env vars.
#
# Leave these unset locally: without NEXT_PUBLIC_KEYSTATIC_GITHUB_APP_SLUG the
# CMS runs in "local" mode and writes directly to ./content with no auth.
KEYSTATIC_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=""
KEYSTATIC_GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=""
KEYSTATIC_SECRET=""
NEXT_PUBLIC_KEYSTATIC_GITHUB_APP_SLUG=""

# --- GitHub project stats ----------------------------------------------------
# Optional. Without it the projects page uses unauthenticated API calls, capped
# at 60/hour per IP; a fine-grained token with public repo read access raises
# that to 5,000/hour. The page falls back to curated data if this is missing.
GITHUB_TOKEN=""
